<https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Contact/hasTelephone> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                                  rdfs:label "Has telephone"@en .


###  https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/hasIndustryType
<https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/hasIndustryType> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                                          rdfs:label "Has industry type"@en .


###  https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/operatingHours
<https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/operatingHours> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                                         rdfs:label "Operating hours"@en .


###  https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/orgAddress
<https://standards.iso.org/iso-iec/5087/-2/ed-1/en/ontology/Organization/orgAddress> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                                     rdfs:label "Org address"@en .


